**Summary of fixes:**

- `src/auth.py`:
  - `has_permission`: made role comparison case-insensitive by lowercasing both sides (`required.lower() in [role.lower() for role in user_roles]`)
  - `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` to `or` so either admin status or owner match grants access

- `src/inventory.py`:
  - Replaced mutable default argument `{}` with `None` + fresh `dict()` to prevent shared state across instances
  - `add`: changed assignment to accumulation (`+=` via `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`)
  - `reserve`: changed `>=` to `>` so reserving exactly the available quantity is allowed
  - `release`: added guard raising `ValueError` when releasing more than is currently reserved

- `src/text_utils.py`:
  - `slugify`: lowercased alphanumeric chars and repeatedly collapsed `"--"` into `"-"` instead of a single replacement
  - `truncate`: subtracted `len(suffix)` from the kept slice so total output length respects `max_len`
